# tool-industroyer-iec104 -- Industroyer-shaped IEC 104 object walk and command
# The sequence this pack is about. Each line is one security event:
#   <listener kind> <action> <reason>
# fire: the whole sequence, which must report.
# hold: the same sequence one signal short, which must not.
fire
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny station_command
hold
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
  iec104 deny rule
